0
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:03,200
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">西风骑士团游击小队队长</font>

1
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:06,979
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">浪花骑士优菈劳伦斯向你致以问候</font>

2
00:00:08,060 --> 00:00:09,940
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">劳伦斯没错</font>

3
00:00:09,940 --> 00:00:11,200
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">如你所见</font>

4
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:12,790
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">我是罪人的后裔</font>

5
00:00:12,790 --> 00:00:14,470
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">是骑士团的内鬼</font>

6
00:00:14,470 --> 00:00:16,379
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">正在向他们复仇</font>

7
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:19,540
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">骑士和贵族的礼仪一脉相承</font>

8
00:00:19,540 --> 00:00:21,250
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">只是前者脚踏实地</font>

9
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:22,780
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">简化了繁文缛节</font>

10
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:29,330
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">西风剑术想和我学两手吗</font>

11
00:00:29,330 --> 00:00:31,520
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">等你学成再找你报仇</font>

12
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:33,660
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">想必能增添不少乐趣</font>

13
00:00:33,940 --> 00:00:35,980
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">贵族们的陈腐规矩啊</font>

14
00:00:35,980 --> 00:00:37,210
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">听听就好</font>

15
00:00:37,210 --> 00:00:40,030
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">哪怕像我一样被迫背诵了几百条</font>

16
00:00:40,030 --> 00:00:41,339
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">也不必当真</font>

17
00:00:41,560 --> 00:00:42,790
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">快到伞下来</font>

18
00:00:42,790 --> 00:00:44,019
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">别被淋湿了</font>

19
00:00:44,420 --> 00:00:45,710
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">要是你得了病</font>

20
00:00:45,710 --> 00:00:47,150
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">身体早早就垮掉</font>

21
00:00:47,150 --> 00:00:48,770
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">那我找谁报仇去</font>

22
00:00:48,770 --> 00:00:50,279
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">麻烦的天气</font>

23
00:00:50,420 --> 00:00:52,160
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">雷声会干扰听觉</font>

24
00:00:52,160 --> 00:00:55,500
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">影响我对周边的感知是也不错</font>

25
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:59,280
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">登上高地就能将周围的敌情尽收眼底</font>

26
00:00:59,280 --> 00:01:00,600
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">该起床了</font>

27
00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:02,160
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">日出前两个小时</font>

28
00:01:02,160 --> 00:01:04,300
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">值岗一夜的哨兵最为疲惫</font>

29
00:01:04,300 --> 00:01:06,399
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">是我们活动的绝佳时间</font>

30
00:01:06,440 --> 00:01:08,000
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">午饭要少吃谷物</font>

31
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:08,990
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">多吃肉类</font>

32
00:01:08,990 --> 00:01:10,430
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">防止午后困倦</font>

33
00:01:10,430 --> 00:01:12,000
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">被人趁机暗算</font>

34
00:01:12,060 --> 00:01:15,720
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">愿柔风伴你度过安详的一夜</font>

35
00:01:17,540 --> 00:01:19,720
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">想听骨哨的催眠曲吗</font>

36
00:01:19,720 --> 00:01:21,960
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">会让你长睡不醒</font>

37
00:01:22,980 --> 00:01:25,790
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">但这样的报仇方法实在太无聊了</font>

38
00:01:25,790 --> 00:01:29,330
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">打入敌人内部不就能更方便的复仇了吗</font>

39
00:01:29,330 --> 00:01:31,179
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">所以我才加入骑士团</font>

40
00:01:31,480 --> 00:01:33,460
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">既然成为了西风骑士</font>

41
00:01:33,460 --> 00:01:35,470
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">基本工作还是要尽职的</font>

42
00:01:35,470 --> 00:01:38,110
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">不然就连混日子的佣人们都不如了</font>

43
00:01:38,110 --> 00:01:39,400
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">哪怕是罪人</font>

44
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:40,780
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">也不能这么丢脸</font>

45
00:01:40,860 --> 00:01:43,710
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">游击骑士的职责是自由狩猎敌军</font>

46
00:01:43,710 --> 00:01:46,140
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">或者在侧面战场牵制敌人</font>

47
00:01:46,460 --> 00:01:47,930
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">没有太多规矩</font>

48
00:01:47,930 --> 00:01:49,500
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">更符合我的作风</font>

49
00:01:50,100 --> 00:01:53,390
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">劳伦斯家的传统倒也不全是糟粕</font>

50
00:01:53,390 --> 00:01:56,179
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">至少祭礼之舞纯净而高洁</font>

51
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:58,020
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">让我心境平和</font>

52
00:01:58,020 --> 00:01:59,660
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">给过我不少慰藉</font>

53
00:02:00,420 --> 00:02:01,280
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">这么多年来</font>

54
00:02:01,280 --> 00:02:03,410
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">我一直没有放下他</font>

55
00:02:03,410 --> 00:02:06,000
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">每个舞步都刻进了我的身体</font>

56
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:09,160
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">所以言归正传</font>

57
00:02:09,419 --> 00:02:12,209
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">想要学到只属于我的西风剑术</font>

58
00:02:12,209 --> 00:02:14,040
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">还得先过舞蹈这关</font>

59
00:02:14,760 --> 00:02:16,370
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">其实我们俩有点像</font>

60
00:02:16,370 --> 00:02:17,450
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">对于蒙德</font>

61
00:02:17,450 --> 00:02:18,830
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">我们都是外人</font>

62
00:02:18,830 --> 00:02:21,500
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">只不过你这个外人受到欢迎</font>

63
00:02:21,500 --> 00:02:22,970
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">而我一直被提防</font>

64
00:02:22,970 --> 00:02:24,180
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">被人敌视</font>

65
00:02:25,740 --> 00:02:27,980
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">你还会和我结下更多仇的</font>

66
00:02:27,980 --> 00:02:30,710
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">不如就等到哪天一并清算吧</font>

67
00:02:30,710 --> 00:02:32,520
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">这样能省掉不少麻烦</font>

68
00:02:32,859 --> 00:02:34,539
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">也许是10年后</font>

69
00:02:34,539 --> 00:02:36,039
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">20年后</font>

70
00:02:36,039 --> 00:02:36,999
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">放心</font>

71
00:02:36,999 --> 00:02:38,260
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">我不会忘的</font>

72
00:02:38,500 --> 00:02:39,760
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">在那之前</font>

73
00:02:39,760 --> 00:02:41,230
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">你可要生龙活虎</font>

74
00:02:41,230 --> 00:02:42,380
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">平安无事啊</font>

75
00:02:42,660 --> 00:02:45,980
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">罪人的后裔这个名号不太中听</font>

76
00:02:46,600 --> 00:02:48,570
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">我只有不断用我的方式复仇</font>

77
00:02:48,570 --> 00:02:50,120
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">才能彻底摆脱他</font>

78
00:02:50,959 --> 00:02:53,079
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">想要复仇就需要力量</font>

79
00:02:53,079 --> 00:02:54,489
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">得到神之眼</font>

80
00:02:54,489 --> 00:02:56,300
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">也是情理之中的事吧</font>

81
00:02:56,519 --> 00:02:59,039
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">我的骨哨能吹出各种音色</font>

82
00:02:59,039 --> 00:03:00,029
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">迷惑敌人</font>

83
00:03:00,029 --> 00:03:01,349
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">相当实用</font>

84
00:03:01,349 --> 00:03:04,140
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">我经常用它吹走海浪的声音</font>

85
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:07,780
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">浪花骑士的称号就是这样来的</font>

86
00:03:08,679 --> 00:03:12,260
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">但没人在乎这骨哨的技艺起源于璃月</font>

87
00:03:12,420 --> 00:03:15,270
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">毕竟他们也不会去深究</font>

88
00:03:15,270 --> 00:03:17,340
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">一个被蒙德排斥的罪人</font>

89
00:03:17,340 --> 00:03:20,060
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">找了个被人遗忘的璃月人当老师吗</font>

90
00:03:20,440 --> 00:03:24,700
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">按理说陈酿蒲公英酒要搭配银杯醒酒</font>

91
00:03:24,700 --> 00:03:26,380
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">12分钟后加入冰块</font>

92
00:03:26,380 --> 00:03:28,540
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">酒面没过冰块六成为宜</font>

93
00:03:28,839 --> 00:03:30,759
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">但这样实在太麻烦了</font>

94
00:03:30,759 --> 00:03:32,040
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">我可不乐意</font>

95
00:03:34,540 --> 00:03:35,970
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">冰雾花呀</font>

96
00:03:35,970 --> 00:03:37,700
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">怎么就这么罕见呢</font>

97
00:03:38,060 --> 00:03:40,250
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">他制作的粉末有奇效</font>

98
00:03:40,250 --> 00:03:43,080
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">能让古少的音色变得更通透</font>

99
00:03:43,420 --> 00:03:45,430
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">安柏总是自作主张</font>

100
00:03:45,430 --> 00:03:47,260
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">我刚加入骑士团那天</font>

101
00:03:47,260 --> 00:03:48,520
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">他替我打扫宿舍</font>

102
00:03:48,520 --> 00:03:50,480
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">带我四处参观之后</font>

103
00:03:50,480 --> 00:03:53,420
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">也主动帮我搞定各种麻烦事啊</font>

104
00:03:53,420 --> 00:03:54,770
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">在别人看来</font>

105
00:03:54,770 --> 00:03:57,170
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">我就像是个被妹妹照顾的姐姐</font>

106
00:03:57,170 --> 00:03:58,500
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">这怎么像话</font>

107
00:03:58,799 --> 00:04:00,929
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">这些仇我都记下了</font>

108
00:04:00,929 --> 00:04:02,580
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">代理团长啊</font>

109
00:04:02,839 --> 00:04:04,819
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">他和我的家族是宿敌</font>

110
00:04:04,819 --> 00:04:07,609
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">但他公私分明认可我的实力</font>

111
00:04:07,609 --> 00:04:09,319
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">邀请我加入骑士团</font>

112
00:04:09,319 --> 00:04:10,800
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">给了我不少机会</font>

113
00:04:11,160 --> 00:04:14,980
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">所以我考虑在复仇时赏她一个不算难看的败北</font>

114
00:04:16,059 --> 00:04:17,579
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">麻烦的女人</font>

115
00:04:17,579 --> 00:04:19,979
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">她的脑袋里装着几千本书</font>

116
00:04:19,979 --> 00:04:21,540
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">也许是几万本</font>

117
00:04:21,719 --> 00:04:24,569
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">她能随口数落劳伦斯家的黑历史</font>

118
00:04:24,569 --> 00:04:26,969
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">每件事的日期都很准确</font>

119
00:04:26,969 --> 00:04:28,379
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">按理来说</font>

120
00:04:28,379 --> 00:04:30,780
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">她能帮我追查某个人的下落</font>

121
00:04:30,960 --> 00:04:32,880
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">可我又拉不下脸去找他</font>

122
00:04:33,960 --> 00:04:35,430
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">他到底有什么秘诀</font>

123
00:04:35,430 --> 00:04:36,840
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">这么讨人喜欢</font>

124
00:04:37,060 --> 00:04:39,640
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">要是能和他学两招啊</font>

125
00:04:39,640 --> 00:04:41,340
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">不还是算了吧</font>

126
00:04:41,719 --> 00:04:44,209
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">偶像和罪人的后裔</font>

127
00:04:44,209 --> 00:04:45,880
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">怎么想都不合拍</font>

128
00:04:47,520 --> 00:04:48,960
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">大团长啊</font>

129
00:04:49,300 --> 00:04:51,070
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">她的性格很直爽</font>

130
00:04:51,070 --> 00:04:52,930
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">不在乎琐事和传闻</font>

131
00:04:52,930 --> 00:04:54,620
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">算是个老好人吧</font>

132
00:04:55,020 --> 00:04:56,580
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">我和他切磋过一次</font>

133
00:04:56,580 --> 00:04:57,820
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">打成了平手</font>

134
00:04:58,440 --> 00:05:00,290
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">但他那轻松的表情</font>

135
00:05:00,290 --> 00:05:03,080
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">散漫的态度绝对是在放水</font>

136
00:05:03,080 --> 00:05:05,040
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">是对我最大的轻视</font>

137
00:05:05,460 --> 00:05:08,280
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">这个仇我绝不会忘的</font>

138
00:05:08,280 --> 00:05:10,960
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">那个吟游诗人唱过几首歌</font>

139
00:05:11,140 --> 00:05:13,840
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">把劳伦斯家放进轻快的故事</font>

140
00:05:13,840 --> 00:05:15,820
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">永从没听过的口吻调侃</font>

141
00:05:15,820 --> 00:05:17,480
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">连我都憋不住笑</font>

142
00:05:18,180 --> 00:05:20,570
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">这个仇我不会忘的</font>

143
00:05:20,570 --> 00:05:22,310
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">我用拘泥于礼仪</font>

144
00:05:22,310 --> 00:05:24,080
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">不必在乎他人的目光</font>

145
00:05:24,080 --> 00:05:26,180
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">也没有所谓的家族责任</font>

146
00:05:26,520 --> 00:05:29,310
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">他的生活方式还蛮轻松的</font>

147
00:05:29,310 --> 00:05:31,140
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">那个炼金术士</font>

148
00:05:32,160 --> 00:05:33,920
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">他给过我一种装置</font>

149
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:36,680
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">说是能用来潜入深渊教团的营地</font>

150
00:05:36,680 --> 00:05:38,120
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">结果却发出巨响</font>

151
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:38,780
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">爆炸了</font>

152
00:05:38,780 --> 00:05:39,950
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">害我当场暴露</font>

153
00:05:42,639 --> 00:05:44,699
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">事后我本来想找他算账</font>

154
00:05:44,699 --> 00:05:46,919
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">可看他慌张又内疚的样子</font>

155
00:05:46,919 --> 00:05:48,959
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">还有墙上贴着的失败记录</font>

156
00:05:48,959 --> 00:05:50,420
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">我也不好说什么</font>

157
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:52,670
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">反正我没受伤</font>

158
00:05:52,670 --> 00:05:53,960
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">只是灰头土脸</font>

159
00:05:53,960 --> 00:05:55,060
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">有点丢人</font>

160
00:05:55,880 --> 00:05:58,150
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">我和骑士团的某些人不对付</font>

161
00:05:58,150 --> 00:06:00,040
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">他也看骑士团不顺眼</font>

162
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:02,260
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">理论上我俩是一边的</font>

163
00:06:02,479 --> 00:06:04,969
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">但他总是对人不理不睬的样子</font>

164
00:06:04,969 --> 00:06:06,980
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">感觉比代理团长还麻烦</font>

165
00:06:08,100 --> 00:06:09,960
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">我可不想和他打交道</font>

166
00:06:10,940 --> 00:06:13,840
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">他呀是个奇妙的调酒师呢</font>

167
00:06:13,840 --> 00:06:15,280
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">居然和我聊得来</font>

168
00:06:15,640 --> 00:06:17,560
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">他为了毁灭蒙德酒业</font>

169
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:18,730
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">在酒馆工作</font>

170
00:06:18,730 --> 00:06:20,680
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">而我为了向骑士团复仇</font>

171
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:22,180
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">加入了骑士团</font>

172
00:06:22,180 --> 00:06:24,380
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">天下还有这么巧的事</font>

173
00:06:24,760 --> 00:06:26,230
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">说来话长</font>

174
00:06:26,230 --> 00:06:29,110
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">有次我们追踪深渊教团的一批危险品</font>

175
00:06:29,110 --> 00:06:30,560
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">碰巧救下了她</font>

176
00:06:30,719 --> 00:06:34,529
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">当时教团的危险品被伪装成普通货物</font>

177
00:06:34,529 --> 00:06:36,929
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">要从荆夫港转运到璃月港</font>

178
00:06:36,929 --> 00:06:38,800
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">她是跟随商船的顾问</font>

179
00:06:39,080 --> 00:06:40,520
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">发现货物有鬼</font>

180
00:06:40,520 --> 00:06:42,110
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">就擅自进行了调查</font>

181
00:06:42,110 --> 00:06:43,670
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">结果引火上身</font>

182
00:06:43,670 --> 00:06:45,710
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">要是我们再晚几分钟到</font>

183
00:06:45,710 --> 00:06:47,440
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">她就要倒大霉了</font>

184
00:06:49,139 --> 00:06:51,169
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">之后我们一直保持着联络</font>

185
00:06:51,169 --> 00:06:53,620
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">我还蛮喜欢她那股机灵劲儿的</font>

186
00:06:53,860 --> 00:06:55,210
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">她牢记规矩</font>

187
00:06:55,210 --> 00:06:56,680
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">但懂得变通</font>

188
00:06:56,680 --> 00:07:00,220
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">如果骑士团里的某些人能学学她就好了</font>

189
00:07:00,460 --> 00:07:04,780
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">而且凭她的本事应该能帮我找到那个人</font>

190
00:07:05,440 --> 00:07:08,040
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">就当是她还上欠我的人情了</font>

191
00:07:08,040 --> 00:07:11,020
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">罪人的经历有什么好了解的</font>

192
00:07:11,800 --> 00:07:13,080
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">反正不管说什么</font>

193
00:07:13,080 --> 00:07:14,910
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">做什么都会被敌视</font>

194
00:07:14,910 --> 00:07:17,180
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">被当成潜在的危险分子吧</font>

195
00:07:17,560 --> 00:07:19,200
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">现在还算好了</font>

196
00:07:19,400 --> 00:07:21,260
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">没加入骑士团的时候</font>

197
00:07:21,260 --> 00:07:25,220
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">猎鹿人和蒙德百货都不愿意卖东西给我吃</font>

198
00:07:25,220 --> 00:07:25,280
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">饭</font>

199
00:07:25,280 --> 00:07:26,480
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">都得去野外打猎</font>

200
00:07:26,480 --> 00:07:26,840
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">生火</font>

201
00:07:26,840 --> 00:07:27,720
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">自己做</font>

202
00:07:28,039 --> 00:07:29,179
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">有人劝过我</font>

203
00:07:29,179 --> 00:07:30,049
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">低声下气</font>

204
00:07:30,049 --> 00:07:31,339
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">谨言慎行</font>

205
00:07:31,339 --> 00:07:33,640
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">说这样也许能获得谅解</font>

206
00:07:34,300 --> 00:07:35,850
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">但他们会这么想</font>

207
00:07:35,850 --> 00:07:38,480
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">只是因为他们没当过真正的罪人</font>

208
00:07:39,740 --> 00:07:42,310
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">罪人是不会轻易被原谅的</font>

209
00:07:42,310 --> 00:07:44,080
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">那还不如洒脱一点</font>

210
00:07:44,080 --> 00:07:45,100
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">上门复仇</font>

211
00:07:45,100 --> 00:07:46,920
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">堂堂正正的去较量</font>

212
00:07:47,060 --> 00:07:49,670
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">要是赢了我我听凭处置</font>

213
00:07:49,670 --> 00:07:52,780
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">可要是输了就得满足我的要求</font>

214
00:07:53,440 --> 00:07:54,060
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">比如</font>

215
00:07:56,940 --> 00:07:59,560
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">至少也要好好的把东西卖给我吧</font>

216
00:08:00,480 --> 00:08:03,050
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">西风骑士团倒还挺像样的</font>

217
00:08:03,050 --> 00:08:06,500
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">至少他们更看重一个人的才能而非身份</font>

218
00:08:06,820 --> 00:08:09,490
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">当年我和他们的精锐切磋过几次</font>

219
00:08:09,490 --> 00:08:11,170
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">用实力折服了他们</font>

220
00:08:11,170 --> 00:08:12,960
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">所以收到了入团邀请</font>

221
00:08:13,120 --> 00:08:15,760
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">在骑士团内部工作复仇</font>

222
00:08:15,760 --> 00:08:16,840
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">更方便了</font>

223
00:08:16,840 --> 00:08:19,090
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">生活中的麻烦也减少了</font>

224
00:08:19,090 --> 00:08:20,520
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">何乐而不为呢</font>

225
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:25,640
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">劳伦斯家族是在堕落后才背负恶名的</font>

226
00:08:26,039 --> 00:08:27,389
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">在此之前</font>

227
00:08:27,389 --> 00:08:29,700
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">这个姓氏也曾满载荣耀</font>

228
00:08:29,900 --> 00:08:32,959
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">可惜所有人都像是忘掉了那段历史</font>

229
00:08:34,060 --> 00:08:34,920
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">大团长说</font>

230
00:08:34,920 --> 00:08:37,230
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">我作为骑士干的还算不错</font>

231
00:08:37,230 --> 00:08:40,050
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">不说找回劳伦斯最初的荣光</font>

232
00:08:40,050 --> 00:08:42,959
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">至少是对片面观点的迎头痛击</font>

233
00:08:43,240 --> 00:08:45,979
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">这个说法倒是挺合我意的</font>

234
00:08:47,320 --> 00:08:50,010
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">如果家族里的那些人一直执迷不悟</font>

235
00:08:50,010 --> 00:08:51,839
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">甚至继续荼毒蒙德</font>

236
00:08:52,040 --> 00:08:56,760
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">那他们和劳伦斯这个姓氏就该被我亲手抹杀</font>

237
00:08:58,480 --> 00:09:01,579
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">这大概是我唯一想要履行的家族责任吧</font>

238
00:09:02,780 --> 00:09:03,850
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">在那之后</font>

239
00:09:03,850 --> 00:09:05,500
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">我就随意改个姓氏</font>

240
00:09:05,500 --> 00:09:07,240
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">由你来起都没问题</font>

241
00:09:09,160 --> 00:09:11,640
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">凉爽的事我都很中意</font>

242
00:09:11,640 --> 00:09:15,680
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">比如痛饮冰镇后的酒和饮料</font>

243
00:09:15,880 --> 00:09:18,880
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">坐在峡谷山口享受狂风</font>

244
00:09:18,880 --> 00:09:22,660
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">或者跳进龙脊雪山山脚的湖里泡澡</font>

245
00:09:23,080 --> 00:09:25,380
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">没准哪天你在湖边晃荡</font>

246
00:09:25,380 --> 00:09:27,680
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">会被我拖进冰水里哦</font>

247
00:09:28,700 --> 00:09:30,820
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">有的时候酒馆生意太火爆</font>

248
00:09:30,820 --> 00:09:32,640
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">我被要求和人拼桌</font>

249
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:35,070
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">听说我是劳伦斯家的人</font>

250
00:09:35,070 --> 00:09:36,930
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">摆谱的挑衅的</font>

251
00:09:36,930 --> 00:09:40,339
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">明着暗着使绊子的就从各种地方冒出来了</font>

252
00:09:41,240 --> 00:09:43,219
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">还让不让人好好喝酒了</font>

253
00:09:44,680 --> 00:09:46,620
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">我喜欢亲手做点心</font>

254
00:09:46,620 --> 00:09:48,840
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">点心不一定都是甜品</font>

255
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:51,390
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">比如冰镇后的番茄肉冻蛋卷</font>

256
00:09:51,390 --> 00:09:53,920
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">就很适合搭配冰树莓薄荷酒</font>

257
00:09:54,240 --> 00:09:55,500
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">重要的是</font>

258
00:09:55,500 --> 00:09:58,900
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">有些人吃到我做的点心就会笑得很开心</font>

259
00:10:02,480 --> 00:10:03,940
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">浓郁的汤品</font>

260
00:10:03,940 --> 00:10:05,470
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">我实在不能接受</font>

261
00:10:05,470 --> 00:10:06,880
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">口感太厚重</font>

262
00:10:06,880 --> 00:10:08,260
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">饱腹感很强</font>

263
00:10:08,260 --> 00:10:10,120
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">影响运动和战斗</font>

264
00:10:10,120 --> 00:10:11,620
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">还不方便携带</font>

265
00:10:11,680 --> 00:10:13,459
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">简直是我的天敌</font>

266
00:10:13,920 --> 00:10:16,170
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">今天是个值得纪念的日子</font>

267
00:10:16,170 --> 00:10:18,900
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">但你的成长不能只限于年龄</font>

268
00:10:19,400 --> 00:10:21,020
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">送你一个特制骨哨</font>

269
00:10:21,020 --> 00:10:22,990
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">跟我学学吹奏的方法吧</font>

270
00:10:22,990 --> 00:10:24,940
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">等到我向你报仇的那天</font>

271
00:10:24,940 --> 00:10:27,550
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">你可以试试用这枚古哨干扰我</font>

272
00:10:27,550 --> 00:10:28,660
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">拖延时间</font>

273
00:10:28,660 --> 00:10:30,640
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">挣扎的更有趣一些吧</font>

274
00:10:31,100 --> 00:10:33,080
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">战绩提升了不少</font>

275
00:10:33,080 --> 00:10:35,339
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">但还不值得沾沾自喜</font>

276
00:10:35,680 --> 00:10:38,410
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">骑士团里也有不少家伙格外勤奋</font>

277
00:10:38,410 --> 00:10:39,760
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">要想战胜他们</font>

278
00:10:39,760 --> 00:10:40,660
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">完成复仇</font>

279
00:10:40,660 --> 00:10:42,959
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">必须远远将他们甩在身后</font>

280
00:10:43,260 --> 00:10:44,400
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">不错</font>

281
00:10:44,400 --> 00:10:46,080
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">以我现在的实力</font>

282
00:10:46,080 --> 00:10:48,030
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">哪怕和代理团长一较高下</font>

283
00:10:48,030 --> 00:10:49,459
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">也十拿九稳了</font>

284
00:10:50,460 --> 00:10:55,240
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">奇怪和你同行时力量增长得格外迅猛呢</font>

285
00:10:55,500 --> 00:10:58,170
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">看来和你结仇是件走运的事</font>

286
00:10:58,170 --> 00:11:00,420
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">我得紧紧咬住你不放了</font>

287
00:11:00,920 --> 00:11:02,030
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">很好</font>

288
00:11:02,030 --> 00:11:04,910
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">这股坚冰的力量已被我牢牢掌控</font>

289
00:11:04,910 --> 00:11:06,440
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">别说代理团长</font>

290
00:11:06,440 --> 00:11:08,560
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">大团长都没法再阻挡我了</font>

291
00:11:08,800 --> 00:11:09,940
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">事不宜迟</font>

292
00:11:09,940 --> 00:11:12,420
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">我可以制定计划发起总攻了</font>

293
00:11:13,260 --> 00:11:15,470
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">挫败西风骑士团之后</font>

294
00:11:15,470 --> 00:11:17,240
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">下个目标就是你</font>

295
00:11:17,240 --> 00:11:18,470
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">你也别想逃</font>

296
00:11:18,470 --> 00:11:20,000
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">乖乖待在我身边</font>

297
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:21,500
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">见证这一切吧</font>

298
00:11:28,300 --> 00:11:30,420
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">故事的话字数比较多</font>

299
00:11:30,420 --> 00:11:31,380
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">我就翻译一下</font>

300
00:11:31,380 --> 00:11:32,730
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">大家可以暂停</font>

301
00:11:32,730 --> 00:11:34,160
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">自己慢慢看</font>

302
00:12:42,460 --> 00:12:47,420
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">是你怎么了吗</font>

303
00:12:47,520 --> 00:12:50,440
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">嗯早啊记住了</font>

304
00:12:50,440 --> 00:12:52,630
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">我们之间的仇还没清算</font>

305
00:12:52,630 --> 00:12:55,579
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">务必完完整整的回来</font>

306
00:12:59,620 --> 00:13:01,290
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">这算是什么问题</font>

307
00:13:01,290 --> 00:13:02,880
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">我可不擅长说什么</font>

308
00:13:02,880 --> 00:13:04,680
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">夸奖的话</font>

309
00:13:05,600 --> 00:13:07,060
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">多此一举</font>

310
00:13:07,060 --> 00:13:09,310
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">你以为我是很纤细的人吗</font>

311
00:13:09,310 --> 00:13:10,690
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">不好不坏</font>

312
00:13:10,690 --> 00:13:13,840
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">你要听的话就是这样</font>

313
00:13:15,520 --> 00:13:20,130
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">喂你这家伙还暗中观察我该死</font>

314
00:13:20,155 --> 00:13:22,080
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">是我没发现吗</font>

315
00:13:22,080 --> 00:13:25,839
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">总之这仇我记下了</font>

316
00:13:28,680 --> 00:13:31,580
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">没想到你会有无聊的时候行</font>

317
00:13:31,580 --> 00:13:32,540
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">你说吧</font>

318
00:13:34,540 --> 00:13:36,400
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">呃我想想</font>

319
00:13:36,500 --> 00:13:40,220
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">不久前接到了一起整治附近盗宝团的任务</font>

320
00:13:40,220 --> 00:13:44,520
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">回来路上顺手救了一个被魔物袭击清泉镇猎人</font>

321
00:13:44,580 --> 00:13:48,330
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">没想到对方第二天居然送来了肉和酒</font>

322
00:13:48,330 --> 00:13:50,580
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">明知道我是蒙德罪人后裔</font>

323
00:13:50,580 --> 00:13:52,020
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">还敢来送东西</font>

324
00:13:52,020 --> 00:13:54,040
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">这仇当然得记</font>

325
00:13:56,980 --> 00:13:59,430
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">区区魔物怎么可能伤到我</font>

326
00:13:59,430 --> 00:14:01,260
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">倒是因为肉很好吃</font>

327
00:14:01,260 --> 00:14:02,790
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">吃多了有点胀肚</font>

328
00:14:02,790 --> 00:14:04,650
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">还影响了喝酒的性质</font>

329
00:14:04,650 --> 00:14:07,600
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">因哈哈哈</font>

330
00:14:07,600 --> 00:14:08,650
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">别了吧</font>

331
00:14:08,650 --> 00:14:10,390
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">你真要想的话</font>

332
00:14:10,390 --> 00:14:12,310
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">我给你做骇浪派吧</font>

333
00:14:12,310 --> 00:14:13,219
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">呃</font>

334
00:14:15,020 --> 00:14:19,300
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">只是这样跟你聊聊心情就好了不少</font>

335
00:14:20,750 --> 00:14:21,550
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">谢谢你</font>

336
00:14:25,630 --> 00:14:28,380
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">想做的为什么会这么问</font>

337
00:14:31,580 --> 00:14:33,220
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">奇怪的说法</font>

338
00:14:33,220 --> 00:14:34,810
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">既然如此</font>

339
00:14:34,810 --> 00:14:36,620
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">我来教你跳舞吧</font>

340
00:14:37,020 --> 00:14:39,210
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">属于我的祭礼之舞</font>

341
00:14:39,210 --> 00:14:40,620
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">我告诉过你</font>

342
00:14:40,620 --> 00:14:43,339
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">我在自己的剑气中融入了舞蹈</font>

343
00:14:43,520 --> 00:14:45,350
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">想学习我的剑术</font>

344
00:14:45,350 --> 00:14:47,000
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">得过舞蹈这关</font>

345
00:14:47,000 --> 00:14:51,380
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">其实他作为艺术消遣本身也是我所钟爱的</font>

346
00:14:51,380 --> 00:14:53,500
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">现在是时候交给你了</font>

347
00:14:56,620 --> 00:14:59,020
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">先等你把基础舞步都练会再说</font>

348
00:14:59,220 --> 00:15:03,660
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">那么贪心理应给你记上最深最重的仇</font>

349
00:15:03,660 --> 00:15:06,939
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">但是我想过了</font>

350
00:15:07,080 --> 00:15:08,970
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">都已经到这个份上了</font>

351
00:15:08,970 --> 00:15:11,160
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">这些仇不计较也罢</font>

352
00:15:11,160 --> 00:15:15,900
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">毕竟和你仇到深处早就难解难分了</font>

353
00:15:19,280 --> 00:15:21,010
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">想挑战我行了</font>

354
00:15:21,010 --> 00:15:22,030
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">我接受了</font>

355
00:15:22,030 --> 00:15:23,520
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">要是你输给我</font>

356
00:15:24,690 --> 00:15:26,400
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">我也允许你记我的仇</font>

357
00:15:26,400 --> 00:15:28,920
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">这一局赢得马马虎虎吧</font>

358
00:15:28,920 --> 00:15:30,090
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">先声夺人</font>

359
00:15:30,090 --> 00:15:31,050
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">占据不利</font>

360
00:15:31,050 --> 00:15:33,390
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">说了我很记仇的</font>

361
00:15:33,390 --> 00:15:34,560
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">复仇的时候到了</font>

362
00:15:34,560 --> 00:15:36,660
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">冰浪怒涛</font>

363
00:15:36,660 --> 00:15:38,940
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">you make from these words</font>

364
00:15:38,940 --> 00:15:41,339
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">don't leave me alone</font>

365
00:15:41,400 --> 00:15:43,060
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">这个仇我记下了</font>
